      <Desc>Raised organization awareness through various digital marketing avenue reaching over 75,000 plus people. Facilitated outreach and demon- stration events to raise awareness and engagement of our programs to approximately 14500 people. This include coordination and logistics that facilitated high school level off-season robot competitions and maintaining and transporting 2 competition fields that supported nine (9) competitions. These competitions engaged 315 high school robotics teams and impacted 7875 students.</Desc>
