        <Desc>Provided direct support for California area teams, in grades K-8, participation in FIRST programs. Purchased team registrations, robot, and field kits, provided training and hosted events. These efforts resulted in 695 teams registered in a FIRST robotics program, which served 5000 plus students, who participated in 3 kickoff events, 38 regional competitions, 1 championship event, 4 offseason competitions and events.</Desc>
